1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:03,500
[LUNA]
Adventurer Kazuma Satou.

2
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:06,260
May I present to you
your grand bounty

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:09,840
for defeating the Devil King's
General Sylvia.

4
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,890
Three hundred million eris!

5
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:13,140
[cheering]

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,730
At this point you're
the guild's ace in the hole!

7
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,850
[SAKAMAKI] He did great work
at the capital, too!

8
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,140
[ADVENTURER 07-A (F)]
Hard to believe toads used

9
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,230
to give him trouble!

10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,310
- Nice job!
- Thanks!

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,020
I knew you were gonna do
something great

12
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,730
all along, Kazuma!

13
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,780
[ADVENTURER 07-B (M)] And as
a member of the weakest class,

14
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:27,860
no less!

15
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:31,660
Now, now, flattery's not gonna
get you anything, folks.

16
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,530
[KAZUMA]
Except...

17
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:38,080
A round of the best bubbly
this joint has to offer!

18
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,330
- Ha-ha, yeah!
- [cheering]

19
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,750
- Drink up, everybody!
- [cheering] -[laughs]

20
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,590
[ADVENTURER 07-C (F)]
Kazuma, will you marry me?

21
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:45,460
[KAZUMA] Sure! -[ADVENTURER]
Be my sugar daddy!

22
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:46,630
[KAZUMA]
You got it!

23
00:02:17,350 --> 00:02:18,850
[hands clapping]

24
00:02:18,930 --> 00:02:21,270
[KAZUMA] Who's
responsible for this meal?

25
00:02:21,350 --> 00:02:23,600
Inform the chef
that Kazuma Satou,

26
00:02:23,690 --> 00:02:26,060
the famous collector
of multiple bounties,

27
00:02:26,150 --> 00:02:28,570
requires his presence
immediately!

28
00:02:28,650 --> 00:02:32,530
[AQUA] As does the incomparably
beautiful arch priest Aqua!

29
00:02:33,610 --> 00:02:35,320
[gulps]

30
00:02:35,410 --> 00:02:38,160
[CHEF 07-A (M)] Um,
is there some sort of problem

31
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,530
with your meal, sir?

32
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:44,540
No, I merely wish to offer
my compliments for the cuisine.

33
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:46,080
Even castle finery can't leave

34
00:02:46,170 --> 00:02:48,630
such a remarkable impression,
I must say.

35
00:02:48,710 --> 00:02:51,510
[CHEF 07-A (M)]
Oh, thank you very much!

36
00:02:51,590 --> 00:02:52,840
♪

37
00:02:53,930 --> 00:02:54,930
[sighs]

38
00:02:55,010 --> 00:02:58,970
Now don't tell me, the stew's
secret ingredient is wine.

39
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:00,180
Ah.

40
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:01,810
♪

41
00:03:01,890 --> 00:03:04,480
[AQUA]
It's tart, so I'd guess a red.

42
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,980
The vintage...

43
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:10,440
a 30-year old Romanee Conti.

44
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,860
Hmm.
How did I do?

45
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,440
[CHEF 07-A (M)]
It's the cheap stuff.

46
00:03:22,830 --> 00:03:24,040
Oh.

47
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:26,080
[AQUA] Well, it's impressive
you've managed to get

48
00:03:26,170 --> 00:03:28,670
this much flavor
from inexpensive liquor.

49
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:31,420
You're far too kind,
thank you so much.

50
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:34,880
I did enjoy the stew,

51
00:03:34,970 --> 00:03:37,930
but the fish
had my tongue in ecstasy.

52
00:03:38,010 --> 00:03:40,850
[KAZUMA] If I were
to describe the flavor.

53
00:03:40,930 --> 00:03:43,020
[chewing]

54
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:46,850
It's like sneaking
into your girlfriend's room,

55
00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:48,860
opening up her closet
with excitement

56
00:03:48,940 --> 00:03:51,270
only to find a mimic inside!

57
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,610
It just had such
an explosive impact on me.

58
00:03:54,690 --> 00:03:56,240
♪

59
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:58,160
You get me, don't you, chef?

60
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,360
[CHEF 07-A (M)]
I do not, sir.

61
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,830
Okay.

62
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:10,040
[KAZUMA]
Well, it's super good!

63
00:04:10,130 --> 00:04:13,710
Adventurer Kazuma Satou gives
this establishment three stars!

64
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:16,760
[AQUA]
And another three from me, too.

65
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,260
Thank you both very much.

66
00:04:18,340 --> 00:04:20,260
I shall endeavor to earn
four stars from you

67
00:04:20,340 --> 00:04:21,550
the next time you visit.

68
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:24,140
[scoffs]
How very bold of you!

69
00:04:24,220 --> 00:04:25,930
[KAZUMA]
And, for a job well done...

70
00:04:26,020 --> 00:04:27,020
[coins clanking]

71
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:29,100
...you can keep
the change as a tip.

72
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:31,110
[AQUA]
Yes, thank you for the meal.

73
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:33,110
[CHEF 07-A (M)] You've paid
exact change, actually.

74
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:36,780
But that's okay, we'd love
to have you back, any time!

75
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:38,820
[Aqua humming]

76
00:04:38,910 --> 00:04:41,120
I like that chef,
he's a good guy!

77
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:43,370
I think maybe I'd like
to go back tomorrow

78
00:04:43,450 --> 00:04:45,290
and order
the place's best bubbly.

79
00:04:45,370 --> 00:04:46,700
- Now, now.
- Huh?

80
00:04:46,790 --> 00:04:48,500
We already have reservations
at the place

81
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:50,750
with the secret menu
tomorrow, remember?

82
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:52,250
Oops, I forgot.

83
00:04:52,330 --> 00:04:54,920
[both laughing]

84
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,510
♪

85
00:04:57,590 --> 00:04:58,590
We're home.

86
00:04:58,670 --> 00:05:00,050
[gasping]

87
00:05:00,130 --> 00:05:03,220
[MEGUMIN] Here you go,
that's what you want, isn't it?

88
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:06,020
You're a perverted
little Crusader, huh?

89
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:08,680
I'm not giving in
no matter what you do!

90
00:05:09,770 --> 00:05:11,390
[both whimpering]

91
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,070
No, it's not
what it looks like!

92
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:15,520
Please, come back!

93
00:05:15,610 --> 00:05:16,900
Don't get the wrong idea!

94
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:19,490
Hey, it's all good, Aqua and I
can just go grab another meal,

95
00:05:19,570 --> 00:05:21,490
you two can have the house
to yourselves tonight!

96
00:05:21,570 --> 00:05:24,160
We certainly wouldn't want to
get in the middle of anything!

97
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,780
The Axis Order recognizes

98
00:05:25,870 --> 00:05:27,830
all manner
of romantic relationships.

99
00:05:27,910 --> 00:05:30,160
So if you two need
blessing magic or anything.

100
00:05:30,250 --> 00:05:32,830
No, that is not
what's happening here!

101
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,380
[MEGUMIN]
Konosuba!

102
00:05:34,460 --> 00:05:36,500
[breathing heavily]

103
00:05:36,590 --> 00:05:38,420
♪

104
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:41,630
I'm helping Darkness prepare
for the endurance competition.

105
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,470
Wait, what competition?

106
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,600
[MEGUMIN] Turns out Darkness
is the reigning champion

107
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:49,020
of an endurance contest
that's held every summer.

108
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:51,520
No, knock it off!

109
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,060
It would have been nice if you
two practiced at her place.

110
00:05:54,150 --> 00:05:55,980
It feels
like a furnace in here.

111
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:58,730
[DARKNESS] My father hasn't
been feeling very well lately.

112
00:05:58,820 --> 00:06:01,530
I wouldn't want to give him
any reason to worry about me.

113
00:06:01,610 --> 00:06:03,110
And he might get worse
if he found out

114
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:05,450
what his only daughter
was doing with her time.

115
00:06:05,530 --> 00:06:06,530
What do you mean?

116
00:06:06,620 --> 00:06:08,870
You don't want him
to find out you're a pervert?

117
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,040
[sighs]

118
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,080
My heat resistance
is even better.

119
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,670
Maybe because I've
leveled up since last year.

120
00:06:14,750 --> 00:06:17,920
Oh, Kazuma,
I was wondering if you...

121
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,130
- Kazuma?
- Huh?

122
00:06:19,210 --> 00:06:20,420
Well, well...

123
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:22,760
what does this remind me of?

124
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,340
What are you talking abo--

125
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:25,890
[gasping]

126
00:06:25,970 --> 00:06:27,930
You...
You don't mean?

127
00:06:28,010 --> 00:06:30,140
[KAZUMA] If it isn't
the great Crusader Darkness

128
00:06:30,220 --> 00:06:33,310
who had so much fun making
a fool of me at the capital.

129
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,390
[whimpers]

130
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:37,520
And that Crusader is completely
helpless right now!

131
00:06:37,610 --> 00:06:38,610
[snickers]

132
00:06:38,690 --> 00:06:40,070
Somebody put me
out of my misery,

133
00:06:40,150 --> 00:06:41,940
I'm begging you please,
don't let this happen!

134
00:06:42,030 --> 00:06:43,780
[GROUP]
Konosuba!

135
00:06:46,370 --> 00:06:47,570
[sighs]

136
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:49,780
Kazuma, you took
advantage of my defenseless,

137
00:06:49,870 --> 00:06:51,120
overheating body.

138
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,750
Whoa, don't say it like that!

139
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:54,830
I just tickled you
till you passed out.

140
00:06:54,910 --> 00:06:56,130
Oh, Darkness.

141
00:06:56,210 --> 00:06:58,130
Whatever happened
to the proud Crusader

142
00:06:58,210 --> 00:07:00,130
I remember seeing
at the capital?

143
00:07:00,210 --> 00:07:01,340
[KAZUMA]
What is that?

144
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:04,550
Ah... have I piqued
your curiosity?

145
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:06,470
Then allow me to enlighten you!

146
00:07:06,550 --> 00:07:08,600
And feast your eyes on this!

147
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:11,350
Have you ever seen
a real dragon egg?

148
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:13,230
[GROUP]
Dragon egg?!

149
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:15,770
[AQUA] The other day,
I had the house to myself.

150
00:07:15,850 --> 00:07:17,100
♪

151
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:20,110
An honor and a privilege
to meet you, my dear!

152
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,940
And you are?

153
00:07:22,030 --> 00:07:23,690
I have spent a great
deal of time

154
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:25,700
seeking out adventurers
such as yourself

155
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:28,660
who are capable of tangling
with the Devil King's forces!

156
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:30,450
And what a treat this is!

157
00:07:30,530 --> 00:07:32,620
I didn't expect you
to be so beautiful!

158
00:07:32,700 --> 00:07:33,830
Oh, yeah?

159
00:07:33,910 --> 00:07:36,040
Well, I suppose it's true
you won't find many

160
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,790
who can compare to me.

161
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:39,290
Hmm.

162
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:41,750
And for bravely facing down
the forces of evil

163
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:44,880
with no thought for your
own safety, I present...

164
00:07:45,970 --> 00:07:46,970
[AQUA]
What is it?

165
00:07:47,050 --> 00:07:49,890
[SALESMAN 07-A (M)]
This is a genuine dragon egg!

166
00:07:49,970 --> 00:07:52,180
- [AQUA] Dragon?
- [SALESMAN 07-A (M)] Indeed!

167
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:54,230
[SALESMAN 07-A (M)] A treasure
like this cannot be acquired

168
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:55,810
through mere wealth, of course.

169
00:07:55,890 --> 00:07:58,020
But I wish to give it to you
for your upcoming

170
00:07:58,100 --> 00:08:00,230
confrontation with
the Devil King.

171
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:01,320
Really?

172
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,230
I would think it would cost
hundreds of millions

173
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:05,570
to get your hands on
something like a dragon egg.

174
00:08:05,650 --> 00:08:08,030
No, no, no, no, my dear,
I insist!

175
00:08:08,110 --> 00:08:10,370
I have traveled long and far
to leave this egg

176
00:08:10,450 --> 00:08:12,780
in your incredibly
capable hands!

177
00:08:12,870 --> 00:08:15,370
- Although...
- What is it?

178
00:08:15,450 --> 00:08:17,420
No one's watching,
no one's listening.

179
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:19,750
I had some expenses
getting it here...

180
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:21,840
♪

181
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,960
Oh, no.

182
00:08:23,050 --> 00:08:24,460
How much did you pay him?

183
00:08:24,550 --> 00:08:26,130
It was a steal!

184
00:08:26,220 --> 00:08:29,510
He said I could take it for
whatever cash I had on hand.

185
00:08:29,590 --> 00:08:31,590
Why aren't all guys that nice?

186
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,220
Ohh!

187
00:08:33,310 --> 00:08:37,680
[AQUA] I've already picked out
a name: Zeltman Kingsford.

188
00:08:37,770 --> 00:08:40,980
And since I'm raising him,
you know some day,

189
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:43,610
he'll be the emperor
of all dragons.

190
00:08:43,690 --> 00:08:45,860
They'll call him Emperor Zel.

191
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,280
[KAZUMA]
You moron!

192
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,280
♪

193
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:54,080
[LITTLE GIRL 07-A (F)]
Morning!

194
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,700
[AQUA]
This is ridiculous.

195
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:57,750
What if Emperor Zel needs me?

196
00:08:57,830 --> 00:08:59,750
Let's get this over with.

197
00:08:59,830 --> 00:09:00,960
Worried about your chicken?

198
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,290
[AQUA]
He is not a chicken!

199
00:09:02,380 --> 00:09:03,880
- [KAZUMA] Yeah, he is.
- [AQUA] No, he's a dragon!

200
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,460
- [KAZUMA] He's a chicken.
- He's a dragon

201
00:09:05,550 --> 00:09:06,760
and I gave him a lovely name

202
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,800
and that name is Emperor Zel!

203
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,300
- Okay, fine.
- [growling]

204
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:12,800
Whatever he is, we've got more
important stuff to deal with.

205
00:09:12,890 --> 00:09:15,310
♪

206
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,930
AQUA]
Hey, open up!

207
00:09:17,020 --> 00:09:18,430
You don't want to keep
your most important

208
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:20,690
business partner waiting,
do you?

209
00:09:20,770 --> 00:09:23,150
Open up this door right now!

210
00:09:23,230 --> 00:09:25,650
Have you any idea
what time it is?

211
00:09:25,730 --> 00:09:27,230
You're always busy
in the afternoon

212
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,740
so we figured
we'd do you a favor

213
00:09:28,820 --> 00:09:30,150
and come here first thing
in the morning,

214
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,110
no need to thank us.

215
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:33,950
You are a terrible nuisance
to your neighbors, you menace!

216
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:36,120
[growling]

217
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,580
[VANIR] I take it you're here
about the boy's reward?

218
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:40,370
Well, get inside, then.

219
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:42,040
[GROUP]
Konosuba!

220
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,750
[VANIR]
As promised.

221
00:09:44,830 --> 00:09:47,000
[chuckles]

222
00:09:47,090 --> 00:09:48,210
You're welcome!

223
00:09:48,300 --> 00:09:49,710
Because I'm sure
you were gonna say,

224
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:50,840
"Thank you for taking the time

225
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:52,760
to meet with
a puny demon like me,"

226
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,180
wasn't it you ingrate?"

227
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,260
Cease your prattle!

228
00:09:55,350 --> 00:09:58,270
Or I shall make your
hindquarters produce aloe vera!

229
00:09:58,350 --> 00:10:00,560
The proprietor of this
establishment is overworked

230
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:02,310
and trying to rest in the back!

231
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:04,690
So try to be quiet!

232
00:10:04,770 --> 00:10:06,520
[KAZUMA]
Business has been that good?

233
00:10:06,610 --> 00:10:07,610
Yes.

234
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:10,070
There's been no shortage
of merriment around here.

235
00:10:10,150 --> 00:10:12,200
[KAZUMA] Nice! -I had
something of an epiphany.

236
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,740
- [KAZUMA] About what?
- I realized

237
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:14,990
how to prevent our troublesome

238
00:10:15,070 --> 00:10:16,660
and determined
little entrepreneur

239
00:10:16,740 --> 00:10:18,490
from incurring debt
any further.

240
00:10:18,580 --> 00:10:21,870
Thanks so much,
your patronage is appreciated.

241
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:24,420
[VANIR] You see, it's only
when she has free time

242
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:26,170
on her hands that
she starts causing problems.

243
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:27,550
[Wiz screams]

244
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:30,090
[VANIR] Thus, I've endeavored
to ensure she's occupied

245
00:10:30,170 --> 00:10:31,670
24 hours a day,

246
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:34,300
even without
a moment for a meal!

247
00:10:34,390 --> 00:10:36,390
Two weeks have passed
without any trouble at all!

248
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,810
[WIZ] Thank you! -[VANIR]
Although she has started crying

249
00:10:38,890 --> 00:10:40,720
and laughing without cause,
among other such outbursts.

250
00:10:42,980 --> 00:10:45,810
[VANIR] Hardly a condition
fit for customer service.

251
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:47,610
Hence, she rests.

252
00:10:47,690 --> 00:10:48,940
[WIZ]
Your patronage...

253
00:10:49,020 --> 00:10:51,690
- [DULLAHAN]
Join me! Cross over!
- [WIZ] Thank you.

254
00:10:51,780 --> 00:10:53,900
Yeah, I know liches
are supposed to be immortal

255
00:10:53,990 --> 00:10:56,320
but that's still pretty brutal.

256
00:10:56,410 --> 00:10:58,330
- [VANIR] By the way...
- Ugh?

257
00:10:58,410 --> 00:10:59,990
You're the woman tormented

258
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,740
by her flushed body,
who spends all her nights--

259
00:11:01,830 --> 00:11:02,830
[screams]

260
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:04,210
[KAZUMA]
Hey, finish your sentence!

261
00:11:04,290 --> 00:11:05,710
What does she spend
her nights doing?

262
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:08,380
Shut up, stop talking, Kazuma!

263
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:10,750
Such intense negativity
and shame.

264
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,420
What a treat.

265
00:11:12,510 --> 00:11:14,010
- [whimpering]
- [VANIR] Armor girl.

266
00:11:14,090 --> 00:11:16,430
[VANIR] There is a shadow
of destruction around you.

267
00:11:16,510 --> 00:11:18,220
♪

268
00:11:19,930 --> 00:11:22,430
The murky presence
of that nuisance of a woman

269
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:25,640
is clouding my vision
of the future a bit.

270
00:11:25,730 --> 00:11:27,810
But I feel I owe you.

271
00:11:27,900 --> 00:11:30,150
I should like
to give you a reading.

272
00:11:30,230 --> 00:11:32,030
[sighs]

273
00:11:32,110 --> 00:11:35,190
Hey, when you said "nuisance"
who were you talking about?

274
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,910
Even the dimmest star
in the sky

275
00:11:37,070 --> 00:11:38,070
could figure that one out.

276
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:41,450
Ah, I'm gonna take
your stupid mask!

277
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:42,540
[VANIR]
Get your holy mitts off!

278
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:44,830
Shadow of destruction, huh?

279
00:11:44,910 --> 00:11:46,790
Hey, quit your groping
and tell me

280
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:49,290
what you were about to say
about Darkness, I need details!

281
00:11:49,380 --> 00:11:51,550
[screams]

282
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:55,130
[KAZUMA]
I think she crushed a molar.

283
00:11:55,210 --> 00:11:57,840
I'm going to start
by asking you a few questions.

284
00:11:57,930 --> 00:11:59,010
[AQUA]
It's all gonna be okay.

285
00:11:59,090 --> 00:12:00,850
They may make you
uncomfortable,

286
00:12:00,930 --> 00:12:02,430
but please answer them
honestly.

287
00:12:02,510 --> 00:12:03,720
[sighs]

288
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:08,020
[VANIR]
Let's begin.

289
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:10,900
First question,
you are a Crusader.

290
00:12:11,690 --> 00:12:13,150
So why have you
been making efforts

291
00:12:13,230 --> 00:12:16,150
to lighten your armor
as of late?

292
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:18,110
My clumsiness gets in the way.

293
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:20,820
If my armor was lighter,
I thought it would help

294
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:22,990
make my attacks more accurate.

295
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,200
Ahh!

296
00:12:24,290 --> 00:12:26,870
Wow, Darkness, you really
thought this through!

297
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:29,540
I thought I told you
to answer honestly?

298
00:12:29,630 --> 00:12:30,710
[gasps]

299
00:12:32,380 --> 00:12:34,800
I... It's just that my abs
have gotten

300
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,380
really well-defined lately.

301
00:12:36,470 --> 00:12:37,630
♪

302
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:41,720
So, I...made my armor lighter

303
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:42,930
to stop gaining muscle.

304
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:45,720
- [whimpers]
- [KAZUMA] She's shredded now?

305
00:12:45,810 --> 00:12:48,980
Very good,
let's move on to the next one.

306
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:51,440
[VANIR] A wizard's dress
was left in the laundry basket.

307
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:52,520
[gasps]

308
00:12:52,610 --> 00:12:55,780
[VANIR] When you left the bath,
why did you take it?

309
00:12:55,860 --> 00:12:57,940
And sneakily
hold it to your body,

310
00:12:58,030 --> 00:12:59,150
muttering, "No.

311
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,240
No, there's no way?"

312
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,490
[DARKNESS]
No. No, there's no way.

313
00:13:01,570 --> 00:13:03,990
[VANIR] And despite
this alleged denial...

314
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,280
[whimpering]

315
00:13:05,370 --> 00:13:07,330
[VANIR] All the while,
you observed yourself

316
00:13:07,410 --> 00:13:08,370
in the mirror,

317
00:13:08,460 --> 00:13:11,580
tilted your head
to the side, and smiled.

318
00:13:11,670 --> 00:13:12,670
Why?

319
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:14,130
[whimpering]

320
00:13:14,210 --> 00:13:15,670
Cute clothes never look
good on me,

321
00:13:15,750 --> 00:13:18,720
and I can't go shopping
for them, it's embarrassing!

322
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:22,680
But then I saw it
lying there, and I...

323
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:26,310
I thought I'd try it
and see how it looked.

324
00:13:29,140 --> 00:13:30,140
[sobbing]

325
00:13:30,230 --> 00:13:32,770
[DARKNESS] I'm sorry a brutish
and muscular woman like me

326
00:13:32,850 --> 00:13:35,610
would dare to even hold
such cute clothing!

327
00:13:35,690 --> 00:13:38,440
I'm so sorry,
please forgive me!

328
00:13:38,530 --> 00:13:40,110
[AQUA] Hey, I bet
you'd look beautiful

329
00:13:40,190 --> 00:13:42,740
in any cute little dress
you can find, Darkness!

330
00:13:42,820 --> 00:13:44,660
I've seen you wear
cute dresses before!

331
00:13:44,740 --> 00:13:46,660
You're not hurting anybody
trying stuff on

332
00:13:46,740 --> 00:13:48,540
in the privacy
of your own bedroom!

333
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:49,830
Right?

334
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:54,750
[soft whimper]

335
00:13:54,830 --> 00:13:56,750
One more question for you.

336
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:59,010
[VANIR] Knowing that
the lecherous boy lusts for you

337
00:13:59,090 --> 00:14:01,430
as he does, why is it that
you choose to wear clothing

338
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:02,970
that accentuates your figure?

339
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:05,260
Stop, do I really need
to answer these questions

340
00:14:05,340 --> 00:14:06,760
before you'll tell me
my fortune?

341
00:14:06,850 --> 00:14:08,220
Huh?

342
00:14:08,310 --> 00:14:10,140
[VANIR] When did I say
the questions had anything

343
00:14:10,220 --> 00:14:12,520
to do with the reading
I was going to give you?

344
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,940
Oh, what...

345
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:16,860
For that you need only put your
hand against the crystal ball.

346
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:17,980
I was merely making
conversati--

347
00:14:18,070 --> 00:14:20,440
I'm gonna rip you to pieces!

348
00:14:20,530 --> 00:14:22,240
[VANIR]
Please, don't touch the mask!

349
00:14:23,860 --> 00:14:25,490
I was right.

350
00:14:25,570 --> 00:14:28,620
[VANIR] There is a shadow
of destruction around you.

351
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:32,710
Disaster awaits your
family home, and your father.

352
00:14:32,790 --> 00:14:33,790
[sighs]

353
00:14:33,870 --> 00:14:34,870
♪

354
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,880
Your intelligence is lacking.

355
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,840
So you will attempt
something rash,

356
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:42,220
like self-sacrifice,
to avert this fate.

357
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:44,800
But all your efforts
will be in vain.

358
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:46,010
Oh, yes.

359
00:14:46,090 --> 00:14:49,060
As far as I can see,
you're powerless to stop it.

360
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:50,560
[grunts]

361
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:53,730
You'd be wise to abandon
everything and flee.

362
00:14:53,810 --> 00:14:56,560
The lecherous boy
would elope with you, I'm sure.

363
00:14:56,650 --> 00:14:59,070
Strangely, he believes
you to be willing,

364
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:01,230
but his fear of rejection
keeps him timid.

365
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,530
Hey, take it easy!

366
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:04,450
You can't just say
stuff like that!

367
00:15:04,530 --> 00:15:06,410
I swear, every time
you open your mouth

368
00:15:06,490 --> 00:15:08,620
you're sabotaging
every meaningful relationship

369
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:10,450
I've ever had!

370
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:12,660
- Listen, Vanir.
- [VANIR] Hm?

371
00:15:12,750 --> 00:15:14,290
I appreciate the advice.

372
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:18,880
Thanks,
I'll try to keep it in mind.

373
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:19,960
[sighs]

374
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:22,550
Kazuma,
we've got plenty of money.

375
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:25,470
[DARKNESS] I assume we won't be
accepting quests for some time?

376
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:28,090
Nothing I heard here
concerns me very much.

377
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:30,510
So I'll visit my father
since it's been a while.

378
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,180
[KAZUMA]
Oh, okay.

379
00:15:32,270 --> 00:15:33,600
[chuckles]

380
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:36,650
[door closes]

381
00:15:36,730 --> 00:15:38,310
- [VANIR] Boy.
- Huh?

382
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:41,780
[whistling]

383
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:45,030
[VANIR] I have a small
prophecy for you too.

384
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:46,740
[VANIR]
No brand is truly successful

385
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:48,870
selling just one product.

386
00:15:48,950 --> 00:15:51,540
Do not be satisfied
with past victories.

387
00:15:52,450 --> 00:15:54,500
I told the girl
she is powerless.

388
00:15:54,580 --> 00:15:58,080
And it's true, she can do
nothing to avoid her fate.

389
00:15:58,790 --> 00:16:01,800
However, depending
on your level of effort,

390
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,420
the same may
not be true for you.

391
00:16:04,510 --> 00:16:06,010
- [water rippling]
- Ah?

392
00:16:07,590 --> 00:16:09,600
Yes.

393
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:10,970
[groaning]

394
00:16:11,050 --> 00:16:12,180
[crows cawing]

395
00:16:12,260 --> 00:16:13,930
[KAZUMA]
So much for that.

396
00:16:14,890 --> 00:16:16,940
♪

397
00:16:23,270 --> 00:16:24,570
[cat meowing]

398
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:29,780
Chomusuke, you don't even
shed in the summertime, huh?

399
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:31,070
[cat meowing]

400
00:16:32,370 --> 00:16:33,580
- Kazuma!
- [screaming]

401
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:35,750
Hey, what the hell,
don't you know how to knock?

402
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:38,500
Let's collect the bounty
on this monster!

403
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:40,040
You are aware
it's completely uncouth

404
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,750
for an unmarried noblewoman
to be staying out

405
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,880
all night, right?

406
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,920
Shut up,
I wasn't out all night!

407
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,630
And take a look at this.

408
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,590
[KAZUMA]
A Kowloon Hydra?

409
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:51,300
[DARKNESS]
And it's got a huge bounty!

410
00:16:51,390 --> 00:16:52,720
I think we should claim it.

411
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:55,390
I believe it was hibernating
at the bottom of a lake,

412
00:16:55,470 --> 00:16:56,600
but it just woke up.

413
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:58,730
And you want us
to take care of it?

414
00:16:58,810 --> 00:17:00,350
Stop pitching ideas
you come up with

415
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,810
when you're half-asleep.

416
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:05,070
Axel needs us to defend it,
don't you care?

417
00:17:05,150 --> 00:17:06,780
[gasps]

418
00:17:08,070 --> 00:17:11,280
You are the hero who slayed
the generals of the Devil King.

419
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,950
Kazuma Satou, come on!

420
00:17:14,030 --> 00:17:16,080
This must answer the call!

421
00:17:18,870 --> 00:17:20,710
You think you can butter me up
and get me to put

422
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:23,000
my life at risk
just by calling me a hero?

423
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:24,800
We've got plenty
of money as it is.

424
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:25,880
Gimme a break!

425
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,420
We've known each other
for how long

426
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:29,170
and that's the best
you come up with?

427
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:30,760
[whimpering]

428
00:17:30,840 --> 00:17:33,010
Gimme some motivation
if that's what you want!

429
00:17:33,090 --> 00:17:35,680
Surely you can think
of an idea or two!

430
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:37,270
Gah!

431
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:39,520
All right, if I must.

432
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:41,350
Upon our completion
of the quest.

433
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:44,360
Um, I'll reward you with, uh...

434
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,520
[KAZUMA]
With what?

435
00:17:45,610 --> 00:17:47,860
What are you gonna do for me?

436
00:17:47,940 --> 00:17:50,740
I... I'll kiss you
on the cheek.

437
00:17:50,820 --> 00:17:53,280
[groaning]

438
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:54,780
- [KAZUMA] Nuh-uh.
- Huh?

439
00:17:54,870 --> 00:17:55,870
Wait, what?

440
00:17:55,950 --> 00:17:57,330
You think I'm gonna
risk my life

441
00:17:57,410 --> 00:17:58,790
for a measly little kiss?

442
00:17:58,870 --> 00:18:00,710
Wha... I thought
that's what you wanted!

443
00:18:00,790 --> 00:18:01,830
[cat meowing]

444
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:03,330
Ya hear that, Chomusuke?

445
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:04,880
You believe this lady?

446
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:07,420
She honestly thinks that
it'd be worth risking your life

447
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:09,920
just to get one tiny
little kiss from her.

448
00:18:10,010 --> 00:18:11,840
Isn't that the most
self-absorbed thing

449
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:13,180
you've ever heard?

450
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:15,220
[whimpering]

451
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:18,430
You little creep,
I was just trying to be nice!

452
00:18:18,510 --> 00:18:19,520
- Woah!
- [cat meowing]

453
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,480
Violence is not the answer!

454
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:22,770
Ah?

455
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:25,810
♪

456
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:34,240
Ah?

457
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:36,530
♪

458
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:42,200
Kazuma, do you mean it?
You won't do it?

459
00:18:42,290 --> 00:18:44,420
♪

460
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:46,790
[gasps]

461
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:49,000
♪

462
00:18:51,210 --> 00:18:53,470
[KAZUMA]
How could I turn you down

463
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:55,130
with those crocodile tears!

464
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:57,850
[AQUA]
No!

465
00:18:57,930 --> 00:19:00,560
I don't wanna fight a hydra!

466
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:03,690
What's Darkness gonna do
with a bounty like that anyway?

467
00:19:03,770 --> 00:19:06,310
Did her family really lose
all of their money?

468
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,900
[screaming]

469
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:09,820
Hydras are a class of dragon!

470
00:19:09,900 --> 00:19:11,690
Once it's removed,
people will call me

471
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:13,030
a Dragon Slayer!

472
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:16,030
I shall finally claim
the title I've always wanted!

473
00:19:16,110 --> 00:19:18,370
Why in the world would you
want a title like that,

474
00:19:18,450 --> 00:19:19,790
we'll have a dragon
in the house

475
00:19:19,870 --> 00:19:21,540
once Emperor Zel is hatched!

476
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:22,620
[grunting]

477
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:26,210
And I hate having
to leave him at Wiz's store!

478
00:19:26,290 --> 00:19:27,830
Not a lot of options.

479
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,590
We don't know anybody else
we could sucker in

480
00:19:29,670 --> 00:19:31,380
to helping you hatch
your dumb egg.

481
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:34,050
I worry about the influence
egg-sitters like a lich

482
00:19:34,130 --> 00:19:36,630
and a demon could have
on such an impressionable mind!

483
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:37,720
Please!

484
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:39,640
When a dragon
is still in their egg,

485
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:42,220
the more time a parent
spends taking care of them,

486
00:19:42,310 --> 00:19:44,100
the more magical power
they'll develop,

487
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:47,100
and the more my dragon
will take after me!

488
00:19:47,190 --> 00:19:49,730
[AQUA] I want Emperor Zel
to be a sacred white dragon.

489
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:52,110
[AQUA] What if all the darkness
surrounding them

490
00:19:52,190 --> 00:19:54,990
turns him into a black dragon
or something?

491
00:19:55,070 --> 00:19:56,650
[whimpers]

492
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:58,450
All the more reason
to beat this hydra fast

493
00:19:58,530 --> 00:20:00,030
so we can get home, huh?

494
00:20:00,120 --> 00:20:01,740
Oh, all right, fine!

495
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:04,000
If I've gotta do it,
I'm gonna do it.

496
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:05,660
[AQUA] But if Megumin's magic
doesn't work

497
00:20:05,750 --> 00:20:07,790
I'm leaving you to deal
with this on your own!

498
00:20:07,870 --> 00:20:10,460
[KAZUMA] Great, let's get
this show on the road!

499
00:20:12,420 --> 00:20:13,550
♪

500
00:20:13,630 --> 00:20:15,260
Hmm.

501
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:17,550
[MEGUMIN] Are we sure
she's purifying the lake?

502
00:20:17,630 --> 00:20:19,590
It looks like
she's just swimming around.

503
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:21,260
[water splashing]

504
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:24,220
[KAZUMA] Apparently monsters
really don't like clean water.

505
00:20:25,310 --> 00:20:27,230
Aqua purifies the lake
and when that makes

506
00:20:27,310 --> 00:20:29,940
the hydra angry,
you make with the explosions.

507
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:31,650
- Hmph!
- Hey!

508
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:33,110
[DARKNESS]
I can't tell for sure,

509
00:20:33,190 --> 00:20:34,440
but I think Aqua fell asleep

510
00:20:34,530 --> 00:20:36,820
floating out into the middle
of the monster's lake.

511
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,570
[KAZUMA] Maybe we should've
tied something to her

512
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:41,910
so we could reel her in.

513
00:20:41,990 --> 00:20:43,080
[gasps]

514
00:20:44,330 --> 00:20:45,370
It's out there!

515
00:20:45,450 --> 00:20:47,460
I can sense
incredible magical power!

516
00:20:47,540 --> 00:20:50,080
Aqua, nap time's over!

517
00:20:50,170 --> 00:20:51,630
[KAZUMA]
Wake up!

518
00:20:51,710 --> 00:20:53,000
- [snoring]
- [KAZUMA] Aqua!

519
00:20:53,090 --> 00:20:54,170
- [KAZUMA] Hey, Aqua!
- [yawning]

520
00:20:54,250 --> 00:20:55,840
[DARKNESS]
Aqua, you have to wake up!

521
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:56,970
What's with all the racket?

522
00:20:57,050 --> 00:20:58,840
- [yelling]
- Oh, wow.

523
00:20:58,930 --> 00:21:01,640
The water's clean enough now
I can see right through it.

524
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:04,140
[AQUA] I guess that means
it's time for me to get out.

525
00:21:04,220 --> 00:21:05,310
[gasps]

526
00:21:05,390 --> 00:21:07,060
Kazuma, Kazuma, help!

527
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,890
There's something
gigantic down there

528
00:21:08,980 --> 00:21:11,270
and I'm pretty sure
it's coming right for me!

529
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:13,610
[screams]

530
00:21:14,980 --> 00:21:17,150
♪

531
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:19,610
[both whimpering]

532
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:20,990
Put me down!

533
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:24,450
I don't like it,
I wanna go home now, please!

534
00:21:24,530 --> 00:21:27,330
- [AQUA] Somebody do something!
- [KAZUMA] Aqua!

535
00:21:27,410 --> 00:21:28,410
This is bad!

536
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:31,040
I can't use Explosion magic
with her out there!

537
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:33,920
[MEGUMIN]
Aqua get out of there!

538
00:21:34,210 --> 00:21:36,380
[Aldarp laughing]

539
00:21:36,460 --> 00:21:38,970
♪

540
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,010
[AQUA]
Kazuma!

541
00:21:44,100 --> 00:21:46,510
Kazuma, please!

542
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:50,770
I just wanna
go home to my baby!

543
00:21:50,850 --> 00:21:52,600
[sobbing]

544
00:21:52,690 --> 00:21:54,610
[screaming]

545
00:21:54,690 --> 00:21:57,150
[KAZUMA]
Crap, this is really bad!

546
00:21:57,230 --> 00:21:58,650
[AQUA] Take me home,
Take me home, Take me home,

547
00:21:58,730 --> 00:22:00,150
Take me home!

548
00:23:30,950 --> 00:23:32,290
[VERDIA]
Verdia here!

549
00:23:32,370 --> 00:23:35,290
Did you say
the name Kazuma Satou?

550
00:23:35,370 --> 00:23:38,080
I've heard about his antics
before once or twice.

551
00:23:38,170 --> 00:23:39,920
Surprised to find out
he's still ali...

